@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 先登录开发账号
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "v21-lab-user"
}

> {%
client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 2. 上传一份清晰化验单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lab-reports/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="reportDate"

2026-05-04
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="lab-report-clear.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./lab-report-clear.png
--WebAppBoundary--

> {%
client.global.set("report_id_clear", response.body.data.reportId);
%}

### 3. 查看清晰报告复盘，预期 reviewReady=true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lab-reports/{{report_id_clear}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 上传一份模糊或不可识别报告
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lab-reports/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="reportDate"

2026-05-04
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="lab-report-blurry.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./lab-report-blurry.png
--WebAppBoundary--

> {%
client.global.set("report_id_blurry", response.body.data.reportId);
%}

### 5. 查看模糊报告列表态，预期 manualConfirmationRequired=true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lab-reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. 查看模糊报告复盘，预期 reviewReady=false 且 comparisons 为空
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lab-reports/{{report_id_blurry}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
